program dup_args

? Passing the same variable twice used to abort with a fatal lint error
? ("duplicate argument"); it is legitimate (same value, two parameters).

@ add3 |a:int, b:int, c:int| int:
	return a + b + c
$

@ main ||:
	expected: []

	pad: 6
	total: add3|pad, 1, pad|
	print|total|
	expected.push|"13"|

	print|expected|
$
